Cando energies from the same Amber energy-function used to write PRMTOP.
Coordinates: exact NetCDF float values, in PRMTOP atom order. Units: kcal/mol.
Nonperiodic; full nonbond pairs; dielectric=1; VDW/EEL scales=1.
EGB and ESURF are NOT CALCULATED, not zero; TOTAL excludes them.
Compare TOTAL to Sander total minus EGB and ESURF with matching settings.
OTHER retains any terms without a Sander label. Raw components follow each frame.

